\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0 Go ye  now and work for The Lord;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj At the right appointed time;
\par Serve the Lord Jesus all thy days
\par Until He comes back to earth.
\par Then together all saints shall sing praises
\par And give us the salvation from The Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  The volume of work is so great,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj It is done through sweat and pain
\par Lots of troubles and of sufferings
\par Awaits us Christian soldiers.
\par But an everlasting peace and great joy
\par Surely shall follow our troubles and the toils.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  And His peace shall dwell in our homes
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Yes, it shall evermore be.
\par Then, remember what Jesus said
\par To us at the Jacob's well
\par We shall drink the everlasting water
\par In the grace of the Lord God Almighty.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Thanks be to all missionaries
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\qj Who trooped to us from afar
\par They brought us the word of Jesus Christ
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\qj To us in our part of the world
\par That in future when they get in Heaven
\par They shall rest in their labour with
\par Christ our Lord.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

